{"obsah":"<p>Saturday for female bikers and Sunday for male bikers. Beautiful weather and enthusiasm for coaching gave Katarína Tóthová on Saturday, and Vlasta with Mára Tryner on Sunday, the ideal weapon for pushing the limits of the riders who came. On Saturday the women rode literally flat out and apparently even flew over the handlebars (luckily without injury). On Sunday we also rode harder trails, and hopefully both the Enduro and XC guys were happy. Everyone rode their own lines, as far as their head and bike allowed.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>For Lukáš Valný and Vlasta, Saturday also included a trip to the beautiful surroundings of the Jáchymov spa, where the springs were being christened. A rich programme, crowds of spectators and great weather. The organisers won the lottery, and although we couldn't use our full obstacle setup because of space, we gave it everything to make the spectators' day better. Martin Šimůnek also rode a few Moravian exhibitions, including the felling of the maypole in Rouské, and workshops.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2023-05-30-v-10.52.13.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2023-05-30-v-10.52.13.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237362\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2023-05-30-v-10.52.20.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2023-05-30-v-10.52.20.webp?alt=media\" al